    "1. Copy the game folder (the one with INIZH.big) to this iPhone: in the Files app, into a folder under On My iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Copy the game folder (the one with INIZH.big) to this iPhone: in the Files app, into a folder under On My iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Tap Choose game folder and select it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Tap Choose game folder and select it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Tap Play.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Tap Play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder on this iPhone (Files › On My iPhone) is recommended. Folders in iCloud Drive work too, but every file must be downloaded first, and the system may remove downloaded copies to free space.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A folder on this iPhone (Files › On My iPhone) is recommended. Folders in iCloud Drive work too, but every file must be downloaded first, and the system may remove downloaded copies to free space."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A move order for combat units is an attack-move: they fight what they meet on the way. Dozers and harvesters still just move.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A move order for combat units is an attack-move: they fight what they meet on the way. Dozers and harvesters still just move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pointer instead of tapping where you want: a connected mouse works as on a PC, and without one your finger moves the cursor like a laptop touchpad.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pointer instead of tapping where you want: a connected mouse works as on a PC, and without one your finger moves the cursor like a laptop touchpad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above 100% the in-game interface grows: the control bar with the radar grows up from the bottom, and the generals' powers, chat, messages, menus and the main menu's buttons grow from where they sit, each only as far as the screen allows. Below 100% it shrinks, leaving more of the battlefield visible on large screens. Takes effect when you tap Play.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Above 100% the in-game interface grows: the control bar with the radar grows up from the bottom, and the generals' powers, chat, messages, menus and the main menu's buttons grow from where they sit, each only as far as the screen allows. Below 100% it shrinks, leaving more of the battlefield visible on large screens. Takes effect when you tap Play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additional terms (GPL section 7): no trademark or publicity rights are granted. This license does not give you any right, title or interest in \"Command & Conquer\" or any other Electronic Arts trademark, and this program claims no affiliation with Electronic Arts Inc. Modified versions must be marked as such and not identified as the original program. The program is provided \"as is\", with all faults and without warranty of any kind; your use is at your sole risk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
